# Recommended .gitignore for Next.js + Node projects
# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for details

## Node dependencies
/node_modules/

## Next.js build outputs
/.next/
/out/

## Production builds
/build/

## Static exports
/dist/

## Local env files
.env.local
.env.*.local

## Logs
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

## Testing
/coverage/

## Editor directories and files
.vscode/
.idea/

## OS files
.DS_Store

## Certificates, keys
*.pem

## Debug cache files
.eslintcache

## Vercel
.vercel/

## TypeScript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

## Misc caches
.cache/
.parcel-cache/
.turbo/

## Optional: ignore built node artifacts
npm-debug.log*

